{"v":4,"catch":"超音速動作遊戲將色彩繽紛地脫胎換骨！","desc":"2010年發售的3D動作遊戲『索尼克繽紛色彩』在Nintendo Switch™上升級再登場！\n在能夠切換3D、2D且充滿立體感的關卡中，越過各式各樣的機關，在其中用超高速衝刺吧！\n本作不僅進行了整體圖像和音效的升級，還追加了新的動作、道具和自訂造型功能等，在添加形形色色的新要素後絢麗地脫胎換骨。\n以巨大的宇宙遊樂園「蛋頭行星樂園」為舞台，玩家將能夠一邊欣賞更加精美的圖像，一邊聆聽重新編曲的BGM，用各色各樣的玩法享受充滿繽紛世界觀的每個關卡。","publisher":"SEGA","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 7.3GB / Switch 7.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/09428391fcda34e6de570b7d385d2f704629fe70586c5729638bfbd2c3f31777.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf87e20e2944969a18664eb762de793c17e3ce2cf42e5bf96f00b7b2e8fb2169.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f55f538c784efaba36f30a6d8bf280bd9395d7875244981921ac55db0905b022.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26224a7c5eafc22472e8a6593fadce544f0278c41f3e38a010166e04d30368cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/65d48b933bb1a124bdf635aea4b6c672408fdae36a2d2ce27e6e46eb6cc5a9f0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34b256d16c3db230c99756bdb8331e6a10a72e3e4e6376669df725ff29c63f49.jpg"],"titleId":"010042d0116ba000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000029602","name":"究極裝飾包","img":"6e70d6e4c5b65ce3c570538c0d433289d8420db186977766b01fb4c587976b13","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false},{"id":"70050000028927","name":"究極混音包","img":"fa646c663904a7758847894a1e5d2a3edc3ca703e94f6516f3dae36fc55c9da4","date":"2025-09-09","mem":false}],"vids":["8COrlHdaIv8"]}